  "title": "iee80211: Fix SID endianness when adding to the tree",
  "description": "The SID is correctly retrieved with tvb_get_letohs for\nextracting the subfield values and determining whether A3 and A4\nare present. The value from the tvb should also be added with\nENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN, like multibyte fields in general in IEEE 802.11.\nRight now the displayed AID in the tree does not match the one shown\nin the column.",
